msgstr "Sørøst"

msgid "Southwest"
msgstr "Sørvest"

msgid ""
"Specify how often Weather retrieves its data from the server. 'Once' means "
"the data will loaded only once after a GUI or system start."
msgstr ""
"Angi hvor ofte Vær henter dataene sine fra serveren. 'Én gang' betyr at "
"dataene bare lastes én gang etter en GUI- eller systemstart."

